# Read from the deployment root. Deploys run from the repo root (see
# .github/workflows/deploy-*.yml) so that pnpm-workspace.yaml, pnpm-lock.yaml
# and packages/* are present for the install — which means the per-app
# apps/web/.vercelignore is no longer the file Vercel consults.
#
# Deliberately does NOT exclude apps/doctor or packages/mobile-ui: every
# workspace package in pnpm-lock.yaml must exist at install time, or pnpm
# rejects the lockfile as out of date. They cost a little upload size and
# nothing else — Vercel only builds the project's Root Directory.
.env
.env.*
apps/*/.env
apps/*/.env.*
